.PP
When the exception happens, use getLastErrMsg() to get the error message or use
getLastError() to get the error code.
For more details, refer to Troubleshooting.
.SH VERSION
.PP
v7.2.2 and above
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.nf
\f[C]
// Create a StreamToken object
var token = new StreamToken();

// Set subscription options
var options = {
  ChangeTypes: "RECORD|DDL",
  MaxWaitTime: 2,
  CacheSize: 64
};

// Subscribe to the change stream
var cursor = db.foo.watch(token, options);

// Get and print the change stream data
while (cursor.next()) {
  println(cursor.current());
}
\f[]
.fi
